WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.469
- What's up there, chef, how you doing?

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.150
(gasps) Oh, my gosh!
- Again.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.420
- Do not do this to me!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.390
I so want another child and my husband

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.950
is like, "No, we have four!"

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.913
Oh my gosh, so, oh, so cute.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.700
I know this is a weird statement,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.753
but I kinda wanna eat your baby,

00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:19.853
it's so cute (laughs).

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.100
Alright, you're kind of
always near a kitchen.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.020
Are you near your kitchen right now?

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.620
- I am, I'll quickly take you in there,

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.540
because this is the sort of, the hot zone.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.573
So, let me show you.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:38.280
It's all nice and clean, 'cause
I've cleaned the thing up.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.250
In fact, there's two
areas of the kitchen here.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.120
There's that little bit now, over here,

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.975
so she has what they call an amazing Aga.

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:50.250
Oh, and look, look who's
sat in front (laughs).

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.150
- Oh my gosh, so adorable,

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.770
do not do this, I have baby fever.

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:55.127
I want a little baby.

00:00:55.127 --> 00:00:57.032
Oh my god.
- [Gordon] And then, Tan?

00:00:57.032 --> 00:00:57.865
- [Tan] Yeah.
- [Gordon] What is this,

00:00:57.865 --> 00:00:58.698
what is this over here?

00:00:58.698 --> 00:00:59.531
This is Oscar's dinner.

00:00:59.531 --> 00:01:02.356
- [Tan] It's sweet potato, and
there's veggies in the pan.

00:01:02.356 --> 00:01:05.100
- Oh, it's sweet potato, and
veggies for Oscar's dinner.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.033
- She's, veggie from the
can, oh, I love your accent.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.187
I wish I could eat your baby (laughs).

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.920
Your baby eats better than me.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.050
- I want another one, too,
and I have five, it's crazy.

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.400
- Six?
- Yeah.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.280
- What, seriously?

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.410
Oscar, Oscar, look, he's in the kitchen

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.460
with his pots and pans.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.210
- I'm just saying, you get baby fever

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:29.357
when you see them, and you're like,

00:01:29.357 --> 00:01:32.657
"Oh, I miss the chubby little
legs, and the little face."

